  "details": "I wish VRChat Plus had two affordable plans in Japan, around 600 yen and 1,000 yen. The 600 yen plan could include group functions and an increase in the number of saved worlds, while the 1,000 yen plan could offer an increase in saved avatars, more saved worlds, and a one-time access to special VRChat events. I think it might be better to create multiple plans and provide cheaper options to users who are hesitant to subscribe due to the current cost. This could potentially increase revenue, but I'm not sure if I'm being too optimistic.",
